+    // (and any pending invocations) until nothing can make further progress, then copies the main
+    // thread's context back into the runtime so the driver's own context is current again.
+    // stepBudget bounds it, so a guest that blocks forever cannot hang the driver.
+    // Returns true if anything was run.
